{"synopsis":"Su Ming dulunya adalah pembunuh nomor satu di dunia, seorang pahlawan yang telah menyelamatkan miliaran umat manusia dan dihormati sebagai salah satu dari Sepuluh Kekuatan Besar di Negara Naga. Namun, ia dikhianati oleh wanita yang dicintainya dan saudara yang dipercayainya, hingga tewas dengan kebencian di hatinya dan dikubur di dalam dungeon kelas-S yang dikenal sebagai Death Cavern.\n\nTanpa diduga, ia terlahir kembali—kembali ke masa SMA-nya, tepat di hari upacara kebangkitan. Kali ini, ia memperoleh bakat tingkat mitos!","alternative_title":"我開局神話天賦，一劍斬神！","author":"番茄小说, 髓针","artist":"MFffff, 熊漫社","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"e3f15ce8-4da9-4531-a0c9-b33b1d8d77e8","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-07-29","released":"2026-07-29","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_7f37b8bb-20a4-4cbc-b21f-0d96365806c7/chapter_ch_46/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"690c5a6c-fe90-4c55-a7